  "notes": [
    {
      "zh": "错误码（contracts/sudt-meta/src/error.rs）：1–9 SysError、10 SysTypeIdError、11 SyscallUnknown、20 InvalidArgs、21 DuplicateMetaCell、30 InvalidMetaData、31 InvalidSupply、32 ImmutableSupplyMode、50 AuthorityMissing、51 AuthorityFailed（UnsupportedAuthorityLocation 也映射到 51）。类型层 InvalidSupply → 31，其他解析错误 → 30。",
      "en": "Error codes (contracts/sudt-meta/src/error.rs): 1–9 SysError, 10 SysTypeIdError, 11 SyscallUnknown, 20 InvalidArgs, 21 DuplicateMetaCell, 30 InvalidMetaData, 31 InvalidSupply, 32 ImmutableSupplyMode, 50 AuthorityMissing, 51 AuthorityFailed (UnsupportedAuthorityLocation also maps to 51). Types-layer InvalidSupply → 31, other parse errors → 30."
    },
    {
      "zh": "授权方式：InputLock / InputType = 输入中有该 lock / type hash；OutputType = 输出中有该 type hash；DynamicLinking 调用 udt_authorize；Spawn 退出码 0",
      "en": "Authority: InputLock / InputType = an input has that lock / type hash; OutputType = an output has that type hash; DynamicLinking calls udt_authorize; Spawn must exit 0"
    },
    {
      "zh": "元数据 cell 的 lock 被限定为 always-success（data2 0x3b521cc4…f7f1，debug 构建另允许 ckb-testtool 的 always-success），所有安全性来自本 type script 与 authority。",
      "en": "The metadata cell lock is restricted to always-success (data2 0x3b521cc4…f7f1; debug builds also allow the ckb-testtool always-success), so all safety comes from this type script and its authorities."
    },
    {
      "zh": "部署：仓库未公布 code_hash，SUDT_CODE_HASH 在构建时注入；本页 match 为空、无测试交易。checksums.txt 只有 release 二进制的 sha256。",
      "en": "Deployment: no code_hash is published and SUDT_CODE_HASH is injected at build time; match is empty and there is no test tx. checksums.txt only lists sha256 of release binaries."
    }
  ]
